1. Add the `signalKey` type and build the `signalsBySession` map (Change B)
2. Modify the transcript-match insertion block (Change C)
3. Modify the single-skill fallback block (Change D)
4. Bump `cacheVersion` to `"v4"` (Change A)
5. Add tests (File 2)

